    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8b120467",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一、调查背景与目的",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d85744aa",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "自本年度第三周以来，拉海洛全境观测到以下异常现象：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_333333ea",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "1，虚质磁暴活跃周期骤缩至72标准时，频次提升约40%；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_245bbd44",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "2，区域虚质浓度较去年同期环比增长31.7%，且增长曲线尚未出现平缓趋势；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a823677b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "3，低频段鸣式频率干扰现象频发，部分监测站记录到来源不明的谐振波动。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_37ffc65c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "依据《拉海洛虚质防护安全条例》,并鉴于上述异常指标与鸣式外溢事件的前兆特征高度吻合，故委托特聘顾问对黯原地区封存地进行紧急复查。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_760b6130",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "执行人员：绯雪（鸣式对策组专员）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d1d50ed3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "调查地点：黯原封存地·止庭",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_71a19497",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "二、执行人员调查记录",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_823e86d6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "以下内容根据绯雪口述及行动终端记录整理：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_33a6c6d1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "止庭的刀还在，但是刃口接触的地面有虚质熔蚀的痕迹。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8ce12316",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "是。隧门另一边的东西正在加剧积蓄力量，但我无法判断它具体什么时候行动。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_80d4d8e3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……我为这把刀重新注入了频率，至少短期内，阿列夫一的力量无法逾越这里。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1292782c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "记录完毕。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_222dd9a7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "三、调查结论",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_11c9d947",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "综合绯雪的实地勘验及后续频谱数据分析，现就黯原封存地状况形成以下结论：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_dcb02f99",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "封印主体结构仍保持完整，未出现实质破裂或外溢迹象；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ac5edfa2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但裂隙下方的虚质活性反应呈持续上升趋势，与近期磁暴频次、浓度增长形成正相关佐证；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9b5f1ab6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "基于上述，判断鸣式“阿列夫一”封印失效的时间窗口正在缩短。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_46be446c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "四、建议与提请事项",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ae31bfec",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "鉴于当前形势，本人提请深空联合虚质科学部审议以下事项：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_cd381255",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "立即解封“夜幕”计划预备阶段，提升拉海洛全境虚质灾害预警等级至二级响应；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c6210f57",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "加速实战用机兵及虚质对策机兵的机体调试进程，优先完成对隧者基础框架的修复与动态负载测试；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f4b05ed0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "授权组建虚质快速反应小组，由绯雪担任战术指导，负责黯原周边区域的动态监测及应急处置；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b3d3b067",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "以上调查结论及建议，请联合审议。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
