    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4f339462",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：40】列车长咖啡厅欢迎您：【图片】【图片】【图片】消息好像是真的。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 42,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 43,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2897e548",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：41】AAA传统拉古那披萨：【爱心】爱心】【爱心】巫女姐姐好有气质！是新出道的明星吗？有她的联系方式吗？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 43,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 44,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9d3beb02",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：41】王牌硬汉：？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 44,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 45,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aa64b14f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：41】王牌硬汉：你给我放尊重点【发火】。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 45,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 46,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_42a6784b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：41】AAA传统拉古那披萨：诶？我说错话了？我只是想找她代言披萨罢了……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 46,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 47,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_484a3b18",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：41】列车长咖啡厅欢迎您：【无语】翔太，布兰多先生是黎那汐塔人，可能没听过苇原的巫女。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 47,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 48,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c03f9420",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：41】我好想下班：可这代灼樱巫女大人的画像都印进历史教科书多少年了……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 48,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 49,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b9b67c84",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：42】穗波疾风：布兰多先生，这里有关于灼樱巫女的记载，您可以了解一下。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 49,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 50,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b408841a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：42】穗波疾风：页面链接",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 50,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 51,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_588c2b96",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：42】王牌硬汉：【无语】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 51,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 52,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f99a8b55",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：52】AAA传统拉古那披萨：我明白了，看来这位巫女在苇原人心中，就像是英白拉多现世一般……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 52,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 53,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c02ec5fe",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：53】穗波疾风：是的，虽然可能有点区别，但您这样理解也没错。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 53,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 54,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_71d0ef4b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：53】AAA传统拉古那披萨：可她看起来和普通的共鸣者也没什么不同啊？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 54,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 55,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_36aaf5ed",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：53】AAA传统拉古那披萨：抱歉，我不太理解苇原的文化，我只是觉得……英白拉多身为为岁主，自然能承担凡人无法承受的重担。但就算是英白拉多大人，也需要寻找传说中的英雄王来和祂并肩战斗。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 55,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 56,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4d4e1369",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：53】AAA传统拉古那披萨：回复：列车长咖啡厅欢迎您：……\n而这位永世灼樱巫女大人，无论怎么看，都只是个和我们一样的“人”吧，她会坐列车，会偷偷关注街边的演出……这资料里说她活了数不清的岁月，一直孤身一人，守护苇原到今天。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 56,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 57,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d2b84f54",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：53】AAA传统拉古那披萨：可光是出没在车站，都会引起骚动的话……那，原本该属于这位“灼樱巫女“的生活，又去哪了呢？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 57,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 58,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_de482ba0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：55】王牌硬汉：……她身为苇原守护者做出的牺牲。你们这些外地人不会懂的。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 58,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 59,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_136ce061",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：56】AAA传统拉古那披萨：我明白翔太先生的心情，正如我们每个七丘人都深爱着奥古斯塔总督那样。穗波人，也一定都爱着这位巫女。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 59,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 60,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_11bf46cb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：58】AAA传统拉古那披萨：但是，在我们七丘也有种说法叫，爱是一种向量。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 60,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 61,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_63bf6441",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：58】AAA传统拉古那披萨：她走过的时间太长了。成百上千年的时间里，这位永世灼樱巫女被不同时代的苇原人以不同方式地爱着。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 61,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 62,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_fd1657c9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：59】AAA传统拉古那披萨：可是，那么多向量汇聚在一起，它所形成的合力，却只能残忍地让人原地打转。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 62,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 63,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bd12ed9a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：59】AAA传统拉古那披萨：在苇原的资料里，人们称她是“永世的灼樱巫女”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 63,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 64,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9e3d5bc9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【11：59】AAA传统拉古那披萨：但我觉得，她其实，只是被永远地留在过去了。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 64,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 65,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_85488a71",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00：00】列车长咖啡厅欢迎您：【流泪】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 65,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 66,
